# 统一行尾，避免 Windows / macOS 协作时整文件被标记为修改
* text=auto

# 资料原文里的换行符要原样保留（部分 txt 是 CRLF），只做差异比较不做转换
*.txt -text

# 二进制资料，禁止 Git 做文本换行转换和差异比较
*.pdf  binary
*.docx binary
*.doc  binary
*.pptx binary
*.ppt  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls  binary
*.zip  binary
*.7z   binary
*.rar  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.mov  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ttf  binary
